=== narrow ===

 think it through while the build
 finishes



 🤖 Job build exited: failed after 12s,
    exit(2).
    go build ./...
    cmd/oh/draw.go:41:9: undefined:
    getWidth
    exit status 1


Checking one.go The first thing to
settle is which of these holds: • the
file was read before it was written •
the file was written before it was read
func main() { println("one") } So the
read has to come first.

The build failed on an undefined
getWidth, and the read has to come
first.
